**Saspar** (Heroic). A blindfolded gunman of the Order of Chaos who
secretly longs to fail. Saspar looks like a cold servant of the Order
of Chaos, but underneath he simply doesn't care whether he lives; he
quietly hopes to fail at his work and so be done with existence. His
magic comes from strange enchanted devices rather than study: a gun
that fires spells once loaded with the right bullet, and an ornate
pocket watch that lets him foresee events and head off danger. He
always wears a red sash over his eyes, and nobody knows whether he's
truly blind. *Art of Invisibility +3, Attack +3 (Magic Gun), Combat
Expert +3, Knowledge +4 (Violin), Quick +3, Sixth Sense +3;
Emotionless −2, Focus −1 (Chronos Watch), Hatred −2 (Excessive Noise),
Servitude −3 (Chaos), Unique Weakness −2 (Cannot Detect Things
Perceptible to Sight Alone), Vulnerability −1 (Holy).* Brim Shot
(Affinity: Fire; Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged; Activation, Weapon):
Roll 7, DX 5, End 0. Calls on the spirit of Phoenix to fire a homing
projectile bathed in fire. Ise Shot (Affinity: Ice; Effective,
Impairing, Ranged; Activation, Weapon): Roll 5, DX 5, End 0. Calls on
the spirit of Ymir to fire a frost ray that encapsulates what it hits
in ice. Lode Shot (Affinity: Earth; Effective, Ranged, Stunning;
Activation, Weapon): Roll 5, DX 5, End 0. Calls on the spirit of Gaia
to fire a rocky blast that knocks targets off their feet. Defense 5.
Health 40, Endurance 40. TV 14.

